==English==

===Etymology===
From {{uder|en|la|iniuria|injūria|injury}} + {{m|la|sine||without}} + {{m|la|damnō}}, ablative singular of {{m|la|damnum||financial or property loss}}. Literally meaning "injury without financial loss".

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|nolinkhead=1}}

# A [[legal]] [[wrong]] that causes no [[actual]] [[damage]] or [[injury]] to anyone.